@Demo.PasswordAuth.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5116

### 健康检查
GET {{Demo.PasswordAuth.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 注册
POST {{Demo.PasswordAuth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd"
}

### 重复注册（返回 409）
POST {{Demo.PasswordAuth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd"
}

### 登录（成功后复制返回的 sessionToken，替换下方 me 请求里的 token）
POST {{Demo.PasswordAuth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd"
}

### 当前会话（把 <token> 替换为登录返回的 sessionToken）
GET {{Demo.PasswordAuth.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>
